# Hybrid CI / Development Configuration
# By default, all services use images from GHCR (main branch).
# To build a service locally, set its context variable to the local path (e.g., ".").
# You can also point to a remote Git repository URL with a branch fragment.

# Build contexts
# Set to "." in a service's repository to build it from local source code.
# Example: MS_POST_CONTEXT=.
API_GATEWAY_CONTEXT=
MS_USER_CONTEXT=
MS_POST_CONTEXT=
MS_EVENT_CONTEXT=
MS_SOCIAL_CONTEXT=
